---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy" description="Privacy policy for Creator Growth Tools.">
  <section class="page">
    <p class="eyebrow">Privacy</p>
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <div class="prose">
      <p>Creator Growth Tools is a static editorial site. It does not collect account registrations, payment details, or user-submitted personal data.</p>
      <h2>Analytics</h2>
      <p>This site currently loads one small first-party script. When you click an outbound link it fires an event inside your own browser page only; nothing is stored, sent anywhere, or written to a cookie. No third-party analytics, advertising, or tracking library is installed. If a privacy-preserving page analytics tool is added later, this page will be updated first.</p>
      <h2>Outbound links</h2>
      <p>When you click a link to a third-party website, that company may process information according to its own privacy policy. When you click an affiliate link, the vendor or its affiliate network may set a cookie on its own site to attribute the referral.</p>
      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>Privacy questions, corrections, and removal requests go to <a href="mailto:contact@hisholabs.com">contact@hisholabs.com</a>. See our <a href="/contact/">contact page</a> for who receives them.</p>
      <p>Last updated: 2026-09-30.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
